"猫山 マヤ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"59694","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"269282"},{"characterId":"59694","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"441480"},{"characterId":"59694","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"571760"}],"egsCharacterIds":["21302"],"vndbCharacterId":"c66438"},"originalCharacterName":"猫山 マヤ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"律と同じく里見八忍（にゃん）の一員であり、誇り高き猫忍うさぎ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"皆から愛されてるのかどうなのか、今日もいじられてはぷりぷり元気に怒っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分の実力不足を痛感して日夜修行に励んでいるらしいが、今のところ目立った成長はない模様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"当面の目標は腕立て伏せ５０回。道は遠い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"シノと律が現状、対立していることには素直に「ひええ」と思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"具体的にどうこうというのはない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"21302","sourceWorkId":"27895","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ぽっちゃりわがままボディがトレードマーク(？)の、うさぎの猫忍。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"北条に仕える忍者の中では、まあまあ古株。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"好きな食べ物はおいしい野菜と果物。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"苦手なものは運動(断言)。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"日々、ぐーたら食っちゃ寝しているし悪びれる様子もない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"可愛いのがお仕事。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"…のはすが、今回は数合わせ的に首根っこ掴まれて雑賀の調査に連れてこられた。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"21302","sourceWorkId":"34551","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"里見八忍の可愛い担当。師であるサトミ様も認める愛されうさぎ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"……もとい、うさぎの猫忍。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"先日は雑賀の騒乱を受け、はじめてのお使いを無事に完遂した。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"たぬきのナナコともお友達になった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"もうこれで一生働いたと勝手に決めつけて、現在はぐーたら生活に戻っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんなマヤのこともおおらかに受け入れてくれる、はるきのことが大好き。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"戦闘スタイルというか得意技はにゃんにゃんダンス。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"可愛いは正義、ゆえに最強。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"21302","sourceWorkId":"39070","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"記憶喪失のうさ耳忍者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"運動能力は普通の人間以下で、何をさせてもどんくさい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"得意忍法はにゃんにゃんダンス。（ただ可愛く踊るだけ）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"相手次第で上手くいけば魅了の効果を発揮する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"野菜か果物しか食べられないが、かなりのグルメ。バナナが大好物。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何から何までうさぎなのだが、本人は「自分は猫である」と譲らない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"警戒心や不安から家に来た当初はピリピリしているが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"次第に主人公の人柄に惹かれていく。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"59694"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fe/fe0968def344e01ac755b1a5c98f1888b25a096759356a02f53136b670e173fb.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2b/2bcafcee23eab66f7ac18f27472d45ebc3e1779909bfe87489fba48d9008c8e2.webp","width":114,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"岡本理絵","creatorId":"vndb:s874","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s874","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s874","name":"岡本 理絵","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:441480:59694:13368:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c82428","characterName":"雑賀 陽葵","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"69776","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"269282"},{"characterId":"69776","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"441480"},{"characterId":"69776","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"571760"}],"egsCharacterIds":["21299"],"vndbCharacterId":"c82428"},"originalCharacterName":"雑賀 陽葵","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A beautiful yet high-handed young lady who comes to crash at the hero's house in typical (?) fashion. Has a habit of saying things are \"quite exquisite,\" but neither her words nor her actions are very exquisite, to say the least. She is all-around very panicky, which is disappointing. She is, however, a good girl on the inside... one assumes, at least. Somewhat of a junkie for beast-eared girls, in addition to lovingly doting over her two attendants, she has been falling head over heels for Maya's charm as of late. And she also seems to have a rather deep relationship with Saiha."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"“Perhaps this is a more fitting introduction? I am the next leader of the Saiga Clan! Successor to the Magoichi name... Saiga Himari!\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Steam"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c82428"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"例によって（？）主人公の家に押しかけてきたタカビー美少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「雅ですわ」が口癖だが、言うことややることはそんなに雅じゃない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"全体的にドタバタしていてちょっと残念。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"でも、本当はいい子…のはず。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ケモミミジャンキーの気があり、お付きの二人を猫っ可愛がりしてる他、最近はマヤの愛らしさにメロメロ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彩羽とは浅からぬ因縁があるようだが？"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"21299","sourceWorkId":"27895","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公同様、雑賀一族に属する猫耳の人。忍者ではないので要注意。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"雅(みやび)さを尊ぶ上品なケモミミジャンキー。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"調子に乗りやすいが基本的には善良な性格で、特に亜人には無条件で優しい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"以前は北条や雑賀本家(の一部)となんやかんやあったが、今は色々な意味で落ち着いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"雑賀に起きた異変を調査するため、物語の舞台となる町にやってきた。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"21299","sourceWorkId":"34551","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"雑賀の分家に属する、猫耳お嬢様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お嬢様とはいうが、まあ、それなり……というところではある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"オホホとは笑う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"獣の身体的特徴を持って生まれてきたため不遇な少女時代を送るが、子がない雑賀の分家に引き取られて今に至る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一応、分家（一派閥）の長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"雑賀本家とは距離が遠く、今は北条にすっかり入れあげている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「そういう関係ではありませんのよ」とは本人談。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"アピールが露骨。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今日も亜人ジャンキーぶりを発揮しては、みんなに煙たがられている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"21299","sourceWorkId":"39070","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"例によって（？）主人公の家に押しかけてきたタカビー美少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「雅ですわ」が口癖だが、言うことややることはそんなに雅じゃない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"全体的にドタバタしていてちょっと残念。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"でも、本当はいい子…のはず。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ケモミミジャンキーの気があり、お付きの二人を猫っ可愛がりしてる他、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"最近はマヤの愛らしさにメロメロ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彩羽とは浅からぬ因縁があるようだが？"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"69776"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3c/3cfae9592b384c46d2559841dbece01e4d1cb535d4b6e3dfb9207e02a4e3fa3b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2a/2a3f744ef5fe52a82b7e891f1d4d200cdf64b7dd10fe370321b84eb255668ba5.webp","width":164,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"夜長桜","creatorId":"vndb:s18157","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s18157","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s18157","name":"夜長桜","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:95292","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c82429","characterName":"猫塚 シノ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"69777","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"269282"},{"characterId":"69777","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"441480"},{"characterId":"69777","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"571760"}],"egsCharacterIds":["21300"],"vndbCharacterId":"c82429"},"originalCharacterName":"猫塚 シノ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A self-proclaimed true cat ninja who wields the Demon Blade Murasame and a member of the Satomi Hachi-nyan Ninjas. She is supposed to be serving the hero in similar fashion to Ritsu and Maya, but she shows up alongside of Himari. Since she is the silent type of very few words, even her comrades think that it is hard to even guess what is on her mind at any given time. When the chips are down and her friends need her, she usually takes an all too galant stance and actively steps to the forefront, but this has the unfortunate result of making people think that she's a combat enthusiast and that the red from fresh blood is her favorite color, among other such misconceptions. Thing is, she is so shy and introverted that she can't even bring it in herself to refute those claims (even ones by her own teammates). She needs kindness and understanding. Also, she is a dog, not a cat. No doubt about it."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"“Mm-hmm.”"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Steam"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c82429"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"妖刀ムラサメを携える自称・真の猫忍で、里見八忍（にゃん）の一員。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"律やマヤと同じく主人公に仕えるはずだったが、なぜか陽葵と共に現れる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"口数の少ない寡黙なタイプで、仲間達からも「考えが読めない」と思われている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"仲間のために有事の際は積極的に前へ出る勇敢すぎる姿勢が、『戦闘狂』『好きな色は血の赤』と不本意な誤解を招いていたりも。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それを（仲間に対してすら）否定できないくらい、内気で引っ込み思案。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"優しさと理解が求められる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"あと、どう見ても犬。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"21300","sourceWorkId":"27895","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"妖刀ムラサメを携える犬の猫忍。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現在は元々の主である陽葵共々、北条に身を寄せている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"たいそう居心地はよさそう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"強くて寡黙でとっても忠実な、頼れるわんこ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本当は繊細なので扱いには注意が必要。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"雑賀の異変を調査する陽葵のお供で、陽葵同様この町にやってきた。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"21300","sourceWorkId":"34551","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"里見八忍に属する犬の猫忍。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"妖刀ムラサメを使いこなす凄腕の剣士だが、忍者って呼ばないと不機嫌になる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本人的には色々と譲れないこだわりがあるらしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"里見八忍所属時代、相棒のチカが逃走したため（後に師匠の指示と判明）、露頭に迷って雑賀に保護された末、陽葵の元に身を寄せた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今は陽葵に仕えつつ、北条属・里見八忍に派遣されている形らしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そういう枠組みについては誰も特に気にしていない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"寡黙だが傷つきやすいので注意が必要。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな自分を理解してくれる主に対しては忠犬わんこ。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"21300","sourceWorkId":"39070","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"妖刀ムラサメを携える自称・真の猫忍で、里見八忍（にゃん）の一員。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"律やマヤと同じく主人公に仕えるはずだったが、なぜか陽葵と共に現れる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"口数の少ない寡黙なタイプで、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"仲間達からも「考えが読めない」と思われている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"仲間のために有事の際は積極的に前へ出る勇敢すぎる姿勢が、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『戦闘狂』『好きな色は血の赤』と不本意な誤解を招いていたりも。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それを（仲間に対してすら）否定できないくらい、内気で引っ込み思案。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"優しさと理解が求められる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"69777"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/27/27e6f768c2555c9d9e2c9dd92fb71360f1b1b88d9854c13631b0037cd9b1e587.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/eb/eb02ba9f8a6b4b0f4ded8f4f2a9751bd4a36afbdce8de2284cf414f79e0b1903.webp","width":141,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"榎木実佳","creatorId":"vndb:s987","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s987","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s987","name":"榎木 実佳","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:441480:69777:10026:1","source":"bangumi"}]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p273","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:1888","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p273","name":"Whirlpool","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:34551:1888","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p273","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p273","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p273","name":"ワールプール","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStat